config WIFI_ONLY
	bool "Wi-Fi only mode"
	help
	  Enable Wi-Fi only radio test mode, excluding peripheral BLE radio test
	  functionality. WiFi radio test shell is available via the WiFi driver
	  for nRF71. Works on both nRF70 and nRF71 (BLE radio test not available).

